<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td { padding: 8px 0; text-align: left; }
  .header-logo { float: right; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for ABB Logo -->
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 0;">SUPPLEMENTARY INFORMATION | <span data-field="document_id">{{ document_id }}</span> REV. B</p>
  <h1>Driver Navigator AWT540 DP</h1>
  <h2>Multi-input transmitter</h2>

  <h3>Contents</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Device - Revision Record - What is new? .................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_1">{{ page_number_1 }}</span></li>
    <li>Hardware ID: <span data-field="hardware_id">{{ hardware_id }}</span> .................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_2">{{ page_number_2 }}</span></li>
    <li>Firmware .................................................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_3">{{ page_number_3 }}</span></li>
    <li>Device (latest SW compatibility status) .................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_4">{{ page_number_4 }}</span></li>
    <li>Supported devices ........................................................................................................................................ <span data-field="page_number_5">{{ page_number_5 }}</span></li>
    <li>Cyber Security info ...................................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_6">{{ page_number_6 }}</span></li>
    <li>ABB recommendation ................................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_7">{{ page_number_7 }}</span></li>
    <li>Licensing ....................................................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_8">{{ page_number_8 }}</span></li>
    <li>GSD ................................................................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_9">{{ page_number_9 }}</span></li>
    <li>Supported devices ........................................................................................................................................ <span data-field="page_number_10">{{ page_number_10 }}</span></li>
    <li>GSD Version record / What is new? ............................................................................................................ <span data-field="page_number_11">{{ page_number_11 }}</span></li>
    <li>Requirements .................................................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_12">{{ page_number_12 }}</span></li>
    <li>Interpreter / compatibility .......................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_13">{{ page_number_13 }}</span></li>
    <li>Installation and configuration .................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_14">{{ page_number_14 }}</span></li>
    <li>Known problems and limitations ................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_15">{{ page_number_15 }}</span></li>
    <li>Getting help / further information .............................................................................................................. <span data-field="page_number_16">{{ page_number_16 }}</span></li>
    <li>How to get the latest information & software?.......................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_17">{{ page_number_17 }}</span></li>
  </ol>

  <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Contacts ....................................................................................................................................................... <span data-field="page_number_18">{{ page_number_18 }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: small; margin-top: 20px;">* DTM500 Bundle Supplement Info is available on the data medium \`documentation\` or latest on www.abb.com/fieldbus. Enter here in the search field following No. "<span data-field="search_no">{{ search_no }}</span>".</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1>1 Device - Revision Record - What is new?</h1>

  <h3>1.1 Hardware ID: <span data-field="hardware_id_1">{{ hardware_id_1 }}</span></h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td>Released Revision</td>
        <td>Released Date</td>
        <td>Remarks</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="rev_1_revision">{{ rev_1_revision }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="rev_1_date">{{ rev_1_date }}</span></td>
        <td>First release</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>1.2 Firmware</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td>Released Revision</td>
        <td>Released Date</td>
        <td>Remarks</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="fw_1_revision">{{ fw_1_revision }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="fw_1_date">{{ fw_1_date }}</span></td>
        <td>First release</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="fw_2_revision">{{ fw_2_revision }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="fw_2_date">{{ fw_2_date }}</span></td>
        <td>Bug fixing</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>1.3 Device (latest SW compatibility status)</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td>Released Revision</td>
        <td>Released Date</td>
        <td>Remarks</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="sw_1_revision">{{ sw_1_revision }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sw_1_date">{{ sw_1_date }}</span></td>
        <td>First release</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="sw_2_revision">{{ sw_2_revision }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sw_2_date">{{ sw_2_date }}</span></td>
        <td>Bug fixing</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1>2 GSD</h1>

  <h3>2.1 Supported devices</h3>
  <p><span data-field="supported_devices_desc">{{ supported_devices_desc }}</span> transmitter AWT540 with HW Version <span data-field="supported_devices_hw_version">{{ supported_devices_hw_version }}</span>, SW Version <span data-field="supported_devices_sw_version">{{ supported_devices_sw_version }}</span> and Device revision <span data-field="supported_devices_rev">{{ supported_devices_rev }}</span> or higher.</p>

  <h3>2.2 GSD Version record / What is new?</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td>Released Version</td>
        <td>Released Date</td>
        <td>Remarks</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="gsd_1_version">{{ gsd_1_version }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="gsd_1_date">{{ gsd_1_date }}</span></td>
        <td>First Release</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="gsd_2_version">{{ gsd_2_version }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="gsd_2_date">{{ gsd_2_date }}</span></td>
        <td>Bug fixing</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="gsd_3_version">{{ gsd_3_version }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="gsd_3_date">{{ gsd_3_date }}</span></td>
        <td>Bug fixing</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>2.3 Requirements</h3>
  <h4>2.3.1 Interpreter / compatibility</h4>
  <p><span data-field="interpreter_desc">{{ interpreter_desc }}</span></p>

  <h3>2.4 Installation and configuration</h3>
  <p><span data-field="installation_desc">{{ installation_desc }}</span></p>

  <h3>2.5 Known problems and limitations</h3>
  <p><span data-field="known_problems">{{ known_problems }}</span></p>

  <h3>2.6 Getting help / further information</h3>
  <p><span data-field="help_desc">{{ help_desc }}</span></p>

  <h3>2.7 How to get the latest information & software?</h3>
  <p>The latest device driver Supplement Info & software (driver) is available on <a href="http://www.abb.com/fieldbus">www.abb.com/fieldbus</a>.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>→ latest information [field device protocol dependent]</li>
    <li>→ latest info (download) [device type dependent]</li>
    <li>- Driver description</li>
    <li>- Software [driver type dependent]</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <div>
      <h2>Contacts</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <!-- Placeholder for ABB Logo -->
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 50%; float: left; margin-right: 2%;">
    <tr>
      <td><strong>ABB Limited</strong></td>
      <td><strong>ABB Inc.</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Measurement & Analytics</td>
      <td>Measurement & Analytics</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Howard Road, St. Neots</td>
      <td>125 E. County Line Road</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Cambridgeshire, PE19 8EU</td>
      <td>Warminster, PA 18974</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>UK</td>
      <td>USA</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Tel: <span data-field="uk_tel">{{ uk_tel }}</span></td>
      <td>Tel: <span data-field="us_tel">{{ us_tel }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Fax: <span data-field="uk_fax">{{ uk_fax }}</span></td>
      <td>Fax: <span data-field="us_fax">{{ us_fax }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Email: <span data-field="uk_email">{{ uk_email }}</span></td>
      <td>Email: <span data-field="us_email">{{ us_email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

